# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Upstream snapshots are stored byte-for-byte as the servers returned
# them, so a diff shows exactly what each source changed. Line-ending
# normalization would rewrite those bytes (portaldoradioamador.pt serves
# CRLF), so it is disabled here. These stay plain text for diffing —
# "-text" only turns off EOL conversion, it does not mark them binary.
chirp_files/*.csv -text
